      "content": "those are good archetypes, but they're a bit generic. i want these characters to feel very real and grounded in the specific neighborhoods of the city. can you give them more specific identities? like, what are their backgrounds, ethnicities, or cultural vibes? i want the reader to instantly feel the \"street\" nature of the underworld characters vs the more polished, classic feel of my lead investigator.",
